      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唔～……。\n说实话，我也不清楚这算不算憧憬。但是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "097fdcd2860d90ac8111c95ff35bb7492cd52f7cbf3430463003cd36f446a15b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
