      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——那家伙的战绩，绝称不上华丽。\n始终无法取胜，尽是些堆积如山的惜败之日——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1a249e08bb87438caa47740e5003d859447b2003409dd8516cc3979c5aaf109",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
