      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说完，她便回到了属于她自己的旅途中。\n我目送着她的背影直到消失——",
      "source_fingerprint": "634a5724ed5587a6013aec8c8e92a6d77eb8fc5e78394bc7b2571d407f6c0779",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
