    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13de53d7a368ec8739126045",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在学园的图书室里，翻找着古今中外赛马娘的蹄迹。\n然而，无论怎样翻阅资料——",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4d5e27eadadb3e1230de28ec632986ddee85a56e78ba1dcc23b1b61b4cf5d26",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
