      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果不介意的话，请让我来帮忙吧。\n别看我这样，我对赛马娘的事情可是很了解的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "691658882b4c0ae734f7601bcd5af5d9db61e142a6c79a70dbf53a299b02bbb0",
